            "line": 53,
            "text": "def kernel (c : ℝ) (j : ℕ) (b : E × ℝ → ℝ) (y : E × ℝ) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=\n  (1 / 2 : ℝ) * Real.exp (-c * t) *\n    (FlatPrimitiveFactor.denominator y.2 t ^ j /\n      FlatPrimitiveFactor.denominator y.2 t ^ 3) *\n    b (y.1, FlatPrimitiveFactor.coordinate y.2 t)"
